 IC FAIL. Venue: Grand Ballroom\, New World Millennium Hong Kong Hotel\, 72
  Mody Road\, Tsim Sha Tsui East (room shared with groups T47-T52).\n\nCONF
 IRMED BY THE COURSE LEADER (jng@hkmu.edu.hk\, 'Compulsory Day School for L
 ecture Group 04 (L04)'\, received Wed 21 Oct 2026 14:09 HKT)\, verbatim: '
 This is a reminder to attend the Compulsory Day School for Lecture Group 0
 4 (L04) on Saturday\, 28 November 2026\, according to your official tutori
 al group.' and 'T47 - T52: 1:00 pm - 4:00 pm'. His tutorial group is T48\,
  so the afternoon band is his session. This settles the October confirmati
 on the earlier verification was waiting on\; 21 Nov is not his date.\n\nSe
 ssion clock: 13:00 trainer briefing on the AI tools\, 14:00 first draft of
  Worksheet 3 (Task E Campaign Promotion)\, 15:00 tutor consultation\, 15:3
 0 finalise\, 15:30-16:00 upload Worksheet 3 on OLE. Attendance is taken fo
 r the whole session: 'Absence\, lateness\, or leaving before the end of yo
 ur session may result in failure of the course.' Bring laptop + data acces
 s\, HKMU student ID AND HKID/passport (tutors check ID)\, name badge on ar
 rival\, casual clothes + sports shoes (no skirt\, heels or sandals)\, wate
 r and a jacket. Create free accounts for the HKMU ChatGPT portal and Canva
  beforehand. Tools used: HKMU ChatGPT portal\, Canva\, Leonardo.Ai.
