SUMMARY:ELEC 3630SEF Assignment 1 (100 marks) - answering block 1 of 2
DESCRIPTION:100 marks\, four questions: Q1 DRAM chip with 10 address pins a
 nd 8 data pins plus RAS/CAS (12 marks). Q2 PC2-6400 DDR SDRAM with tCL-tRC
 D-tRP-tRAS = 2-7-9-10\, including the memory cycle time for 8 consecutive 
 datawords without precharge (24 marks). Q3 two set-associative caches\, co
 mplete the parameter table (40 marks). Q4 the LPDDR video\, three advantag
 es of LPDDR4(x) over LPDDR3 and of LPDDR5 over LPDDR4(x) (24 marks). Draw 
 on Lecture 1-3 and Tutorials 2-3. PDF only\, name + student number on page
  1\, show steps\, upload to OLE\, never by email.
END:VEVENT
